WEBVTT

00:16:30.952 --> 00:16:33.000
♫ Respira apenas ♫

00:16:34.047 --> 00:16:35.866
♫ E agora as palavras cantam ♫

00:16:36.028 --> 00:16:37.600
♫ Hei! ♫

00:16:38.437 --> 00:16:40.342
♫ Tu estás bem ♫

00:16:42.018 --> 00:16:44.190
♫ Vais ficar bem ♫

00:16:45.752 --> 00:16:47.780
♫ Respira apenas ♫

00:16:48.438 --> 00:16:50.247
♫ Agora todos juntos ♫

00:16:50.628 --> 00:16:52.028
♫ Hei! ♫

00:16:53.266 --> 00:16:55.314
♫ Tu estás bem ♫

00:16:56.619 --> 00:16:59.019
♫ Vais ficar bem ♫